{'symbol': 'J', 'date': '2022-01-26 17:19:00', 'title': 'JACOBS INCREASES QUARTERLY DIVIDEND', 'text': 'DALLAS, JAN. 26, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0THE BOARD OF DIRECTORS OF JACOBS (NYSE:J) HAS DECLARED A QUARTERLY CASH DIVIDEND PAYABLE TO SHAREHOLDERS IN THE AMOUNT OF $0.23 PER SHARE OF JACOBS COMMON STOCK,\xa0AN INCREASE OF 10% FROM ITS PREVIOUS QUARTERLY DIVIDEND OF $0.21.\xa0THIS DIVIDEND WILL BE PAID ON MARCH 25, 2022, TO SHAREHOLDERS OF RECORD AS OF THE CLOSE OF BUSINESS ON FEB. 25, 2022.'}